{"ts":"2026-07-27T23:21:15.888Z","author":"claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"35b9d3a4f229d0ed12de83b0","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-27T23:21:15.887Z","author":"claude-code","text":"Release attribution corrected from 2026.6.7 to 2026.6.8. The original value came from mapping the item's last-activity DATE to a same-day release, which is unsound to the hour: v2026.06.07 was tagged at 07:15:36Z and the implementing merge c9060ed landed at 08:12Z, so the 2026.6.7 release provably does NOT contain this work. Verified by containment rather than dates - git merge-base --is-ancestor c9060ed v2026.06.07 fails while v2026.06.08 succeeds, making v2026.06.08 the first release that actually carried it. Greptile surfaced this class of error on the sibling pm-web PR #67 by spotting a historical release predating its implementation."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-27T23:21:15.888Z"}],"before_hash":"0e5bdc1c304d5ab6460c9e6115501465934b5639da11aec1f94c4fb9d158d060","after_hash":"707238382fb66b5f9297b486fa9c65b0f424ff9c4902490dd0b1df318da57f8c"}
{"ts":"2026-07-27T23:23:54.517Z","author":"claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"35b9d3a4f229d0ed12de83b0","op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Before this closeout the item had remained in_progress with no activity since its work shipped, so the delivery was missing from the changelog while still counting as open work in every fleet audit. A first attempt then filed it under 2026.6.7, a release cut before the work landed and therefore unable to contain it."},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A closed item whose changelog entry appears under the 2026.6.8 heading, the first release whose tree contains the hardening-wave merge, leaving the current release notes untouched."},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/resolution","value":"Work completed and released in 2026.6.8. Release attribution set explicitly so pm-changelog --respect-item-release files the entry under 2026.6.8, the first release that actually contains the implementing merge c9060ed. An earlier revision of this record said 2026.6.7; that was wrong, because v2026.06.07 was tagged at 07:15:36Z and the merge landed at 08:12Z."},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-27T23:23:54.517Z"}],"before_hash":"707238382fb66b5f9297b486fa9c65b0f424ff9c4902490dd0b1df318da57f8c","after_hash":"069155adbede2e3a3303bcda49c426756ffdf4a094434a15a250309403a9ee2e"}
{"ts":"2026-07-27T23:23:54.868Z","author":"claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"35b9d3a4f229d0ed12de83b0","op":"close","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"Retired as shipped: the full-cycle hardening wave for pm-csv was completed and released in 2026.6.8, verified by containment (git merge-base --is-ancestor c9060ed v2026.06.08 succeeds while v2026.06.07 fails). The item was never closed and sat in progress for seven weeks, inflating every fleet audit."},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/closed_at","value":"2026-07-27T23:23:54.868Z"},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-27T23:23:54.868Z"}],"before_hash":"069155adbede2e3a3303bcda49c426756ffdf4a094434a15a250309403a9ee2e","after_hash":"85f6eb3793ae52ae8ae3284d7270600b5a136c8e73fb36a8f0535d795bfe9e80"}
